<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>mlx_loop_hook(mlx,<sp/>ft_randomize,<sp/>mlx);</highlight></codeline>
